            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Put your money to work so you don't get left behind",
            "description": "<p>When it comes to the wealth disparity between Black and White families, America has a lot of catching up to do: in fact, the median gap between Black and White households is $172,000, according to a survey from Brookings. On this episode of Decoding Retirement, Robert \"Bob\" Powell speaks with Chris Wilson, H&R Block franchisee and author of \"How To Make Your Nest Egg Last A Lifetime.\" Chris discusses his strategies for promoting financial literacy, the benefits of opportunity zones, and strategies to help build wealth for the next generation.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance's<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/decoding-retirement/\"> Decoding Retirement</a> is hosted by Robert Powell.</p>\n<p>Find more episodes of Decoding Retirement at <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/decoding-retirement\">https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/decoding-retirement</a>.</p>",
